       "source": "PubMed",
       "id": "41398051"
      }
     ],
     "value": "Plays a role in the regulation of mitochondrial morphology (PubMed:15155745, PubMed:15985469). Inhibits mitochondrial fusion by creating a non-fusogenic lipid environment which affects OPA1 oligomerization and its subsequent capacity to drive fusion (PubMed:38851188). This prevents defective inner mitochondrial membrane (IMM) subdomains from fusing with other mitochondria, facilitating their segregation into small MTFP1-enriched mitochondria (SMEM) which are targeted for autophagic degradation (PubMed:38851188, PubMed:41398051). This IMM quality control mechanism controls mitochondrial DNA levels (PubMed:38851188)"
    }
   ],
   "commentType": "FUNCTION"
  },
